    sa: ["How does 1 Corinthians 12:4-6 show the Trinity at work in gifts?", ["spirit", "lord", "god", "gifts", "service", "same"], "A good answer says the Spirit gives gifts, the Lord Jesus directs service, and the Father empowers activities, so the gifts come from the one God and exalt Jesus."],
